---
import Layout from '../../components/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="AffiliateBharat's full affiliate disclosure policy — how we make money, how commissions (don't) affect prices, and how rankings are built."
  lang="en"
  canonicalPath="/en/disclosure/"
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/en/' }, { label: 'Disclosure' }]} />
  <article class="page">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="lede">Straight talk, no fine print.</p>

    <h2>Reader-supported model</h2>
    <p>
      AffiliateBharat is reader-supported. Some links on this site are <strong>affiliate links</strong> —
      meaning if you buy through them, we may earn a commission from that company.
    </p>

    <h2>No extra cost to you</h2>
    <p>
      The commission comes out of the company's pocket. The price you see is the price you pay —
      buying through our link <strong>never costs you more</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2>Rankings are not for sale</h2>
    <p>
      No company can pay to rank higher in our comparisons. Our verdicts are based on research —
      not commission rates. Even where we earn more, we write what the data says.
    </p>

    <h2>What we disclose</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every article carries an affiliate disclosure box at the top.</li>
      <li>Affiliate links use <code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code> — transparent to search engines too.</li>
      <li>Our methodology is published on the <a href="/en/about/">about page</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>
      If you doubt any link or recommendation, check the article's <em>last verified</em> date
      and confirm on the official site. That's always the safest move.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 760px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .page h2 { margin: 2.2rem 0 0.8rem; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .page p, .page li { font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .page ul { padding-left: 1.4rem; }
  .page li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
</style>
